<h1>Give your security and privacy the attention they deserve.</h1>
<p>You can come with a concern or simply a wish to take better care of your digital life. Dr. Lior Tabansky works with you, in person: first to inspect relevant access, diagnose what matters and make approved urgent fixes within scope; then, through a separately agreed full engagement, to harden your setup and teach you how to use it.</p>
<p><strong>All prices include VAT.</strong></p>
<p><strong><a class="btn" href="#contact">Request a private conversation</a></strong></p>
